TG WS Proxy Mobile

This project reimplements, in Kotlin, the local MTProto-over-WebSocket proxy
approach of:

  Flowseal/tg-ws-proxy — https://github.com/Flowseal/tg-ws-proxy
  Copyright (c) Flowseal and contributors
  Licensed under the MIT License.

No Python source code from that project is included here. The protocol
constants and the re-encryption scheme follow the publicly documented
MTProto obfuscated2 transport and the reference implementation above.

"Telegram" is a trademark of Telegram Messenger Inc. This project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Telegram.


Python engine (optional, switchable in Settings): the unmodified `proxy/` package of
Flowseal/tg-ws-proxy 1.12.0 (https://github.com/Flowseal/tg-ws-proxy), MIT License, bundled
in android/app/src/main/python/proxy together with its license text (UPSTREAM_LICENSE.txt).
It runs on Chaquopy (MIT License, https://github.com/chaquo/chaquopy) with the httpx[http2]
and cryptography packages, which are installed at build time.
